<PageTitle>Free and Club allowances — Interlock Expeditions</PageTitle>
<p class="eyebrow">Capacity, without pretend checkout</p><h1>Small crews can play for free.</h1><p>Every published ready episode can be played with the free room allowance. A crew guest never needs to buy access just to join a host's room.</p><div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>Free host</h2><ul><li>Two active rooms</li><li>Up to six guest devices per room, split between two crews</li><li>All currently published ready episodes</li><li>Real shared progress, pause and reconnect</li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/host">Host a free expedition</a></section><section class="panel"><h2>Club host</h2><p>Server allowances support twelve active rooms and twelve guest devices per room after a verified paid entitlement. These capacities do not change a puzzle's rules.</p><p class="notice">Checkout is unavailable until the owner configures a real payment provider. No payment, subscription or higher allowance is being represented by this page.</p></section></div><p>No audience size, revenue or customer demand is claimed. Advertising, when configured for public discovery content, also requires the owner's approved publisher settings and consent setup.</p>
